--- !u!114 &772177704
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 772177703}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 55198c051ec3c4c758f033995353fa1a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneImages: []
  sceneTexts:
  - "A friend might upset you, leading to strong emotions. To handle these emotions,
    try self-talk \u2013 talking to yourself with calming words or phrases. Some
    examples of self-talk are: \\n\\n    > \u201CI can do this\u201D\\n    > \u201CI
    will do my best\u201D \\n    > \u201CMy friends like me\u201D\\n    > \u201CI
    can try again\u201D"
  sceneQuestions:
  - 'What self-talk would you use to calm down?  '
  wordDelay: 0.1
  scenario2scene: {fileID: 984780047}
  scenario2question: {fileID: 1016572508}
  jibo: {fileID: 1726146626}
  next: {fileID: 19023701}
  tTSManager: {fileID: 1209166630}
  delayTime: 2
  jiboButtonIsClicked: 0
  ASRCanvas: {fileID: 746069947}
  whisper: {fileID: 720057557}
  databaseManager: {fileID: 0}
  canvasOn: 0
  recordButtonIsClicked: 0
  correctResponse: "Any response that is self motivational similar to \u201CI can
    do this\u201D, \u201CI will do my best\u201D, \u201CMy friends like me\u201D,
    \u201CI can try again\u201D"
  childResponse: 
  characterName: yourself
  feelingType: 'Any response that is self motivational and positive about oneself. '
  jiboCorrectResponse: Fantastic job! You're really nailing this positive self-talk.
    Can you think of other ways you might use those encouraging words to make yourself
    feel better in similar situations?
  jiboIncorrectResponse: I understand that your friend's words may have hurt you.
    It's tough when things don't go well with friends. What kind of self-talk do
    you think would be helpful to calm yourself down during moments like these?
  jiboNRResponse: That's okay if you're not sure what to do. Finding the right words
    can be a challenge in the moment. How about we brainstorm together! What are
    some positive self-talk phrases that you think could help you feel more at ease
    and better about the situation?
